  _name: 
  Speaker: 
  lines:
  - 'Detective: Previously when I talked to you, you said that you where cleaning
    in the back but when I checked on your cart, I found that nothing was used. Now
    will you tell me the truth.'
  - 'Antonio: I went to the back and then someone called me outside to help them
    move some things.'
